    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Gia Leeming",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102931824183371915356/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUdPt93pPy4HGXGI5tuH_TL0iYzmYjyzA7Kr9qEzpc9cbV1j2XyPg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I recently attended an auction at this auction house and was thoroughly impressed with the knowledge and expertise of the staff. They were incredibly helpful in helping me identify valuable antiques and providing me with all the information I needed to make informed purchase decisions. The atmosphere was welcoming and the selection of items up for auction was impressive. I would highly recommend this auction house to anyone looking to buy or sell antiques.",
        "time": 1723478691,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alex Flanagan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104362484921363851743/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVMeNxML16YsgGzq97qWm_9B2yUnwwouY1k2uMNao5MiWoc40qo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I won a relatively fancy watch and accidentally received the wrong item -- Debbie and Gary gave amazing customer service to correct the issue, with Gary taking time out of his vacation to help. I would otherwise have been largely out-of-luck.\n\nHighly trustworthy people and I recommend them for other watch collectors.",
        "time": 1714054312,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Candis Noble - Courtier immobilier Montréal",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117380238095993193901/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJmo6apZmljtpOAxs_aTSE_uJM2cNKGyvL7o8zwXuaVezQYOKt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I have purchased many items from Coach House Auctions; not only are the items gorgeous but the experience is always fun and enjoyable to all who attend. Now they're even doing online bidding... yet another way to enjoy the excitement of buying at auction. Gary and Debbie are wonderful; thank you for the many treasures I bought over the years... I can't wait to see what's up for auction this week!",
        "time": 1592661981,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "JL -",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104400629945805858602/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7AdPLLLmREdN0F8_GuxQsIhjRluSrdZUzaq7fSK0b3gRXMm-L=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I entrusted a Windsor chair and 2 carpets to the owner. I never got a call back and when I asked about whether they had sold, I was told I was too late, they had no record and tough luck.  So, they took my money and gave me nothing and deny any responsibility for it.  When I suggested that they could check with their accountants I was told their accountant died and the man became very aggressive with me even though I asked very calmly.  My wife brought some things to auction and did get some money from him.  But overall, I don't understand his attitude and don't accept not taking responsibility for goods entrusted to him - makes no sense.\nOf course, he used to say he didn't know what happened to the items, now he says \"they were never sold\".  Funny that he doesn't know how to use a telephone.  Probably would find the items sitting in his or a friend's home.",
        "time": 1582838520,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jason Liverman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100642668486839238082/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU4ZAyr4omy3-LZ3rn8yjAnUcCSV2ozewmW4CTnFUsgkAvxuRw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Coach House Auctions are a fair and professional company; Debbie and Gary are a pleasure to deal with, highly recommended.",
        "time": 1723228617,
        "translated": false
      }
